   The power bank now loses 7% per hour, so the total loss over 3 hours is:  
   \( 3 \times 7\% = 21\% \).  
   Remaining charge after 3 more hours:  
   \( (x - 45\%) - 21\% = x - 66\% \).

3. **Final charge:**  
   The remaining charge is given as 28%, so:  
   \( x - 66\% = 28\% \).  
