     \frac{132 + T - 1}{5} \geq 40
     \]
     \[
     \frac{131 + T}{5} \geq 40
     \]
     \[
     131 + T \geq 200
     \]
     \[
     T \geq 69
     \]

6. **Conclusion:**
   - The second bottle must be at least 69°F to allow Donny to drink the water after the pours.

